  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy Community of South East Europe APL Program - APL6 for Albania  Electricity Distribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This will be the second ECSEE APL for Albania. At this stage, the project is not defined but a major component is likely to be upgrading of safety aspects of the major hydropower dams in Albania and related rehabilitation.  The project is likely to involve significant cofinancing.</narrative>
